    "Ask the hut what bedding or liner to bring." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Frage bei der Hütte nach Bettzeug und Hüttenschlafsack."}}}},
    "Spare walking socks" : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ersatzwandersocken"}}}},
    "Easy-to-reach snack pouch" : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Griffbereite Snacktasche"}}}},
    "Small sit mat" : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kleines Sitzkissen"}}}},
    "Dry bags for spare kit" : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Packsäcke für Wechselkleidung"}}}},
    "Tent repair supplies" : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Zeltreparaturset"}}}},
    "Earplugs for the hut" : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ohrstöpsel für die Hütte"}}}},
    "AI-selected option · An optional dry pair to change into during your outing." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "KI-Vorschlag · Ein trockenes Paar zum Wechseln unterwegs."}}}},
    "AI-selected option · Keep your planned snacks accessible while walking." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "KI-Vorschlag · Halte deine Snacks beim Wandern griffbereit."}}}},
    "AI-selected option · An optional seat for planned breaks." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "KI-Vorschlag · Eine Sitzunterlage für deine Pausen."}}}},
    "AI-selected option · Separate spare clothing and supplies inside your pack." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "KI-Vorschlag · Verstaue Wechselkleidung und Vorräte getrennt im Rucksack."}}}},
    "AI-selected option · For your selected camping stay, match spares to your tent." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "KI-Vorschlag · Wähle Ersatzteile passend zu deinem Zelt."}}}},
    "AI-selected option · For your selected hut stay, consider shared sleeping spaces." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "KI-Vorschlag · Denke an gemeinsam genutzte Schlafräume in der Hütte."}}}},
    "Choose your clothing after checking the forecast for your departure." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Wähle deine Kleidung nach einem Blick auf die Vorhersage für deinen Start."}}}},
    "Plan meals and breaks around the mapped duration, with room for delays." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Plane Mahlzeiten und Pausen zur berechneten Dauer, mit Puffer für Verzögerungen."}}}},
    "Check that your footwear fits and suits the terrain you have reviewed." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Prüfe, ob deine Schuhe passen und für das geplante Gelände geeignet sind."}}}},
