    "Saves locally first. No account needed." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wird zuerst lokal gespeichert. Kein Konto nötig." } } } },
    "Start place" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Startort" } } } },
    "Starting Route Guidance" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Routenführung wird gestartet" } } } },
    "Stored on this iPhone. Relevant defaults are included when you allow online route planning." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Auf diesem iPhone gespeichert. Relevante Vorgaben fließen ein, wenn du die Online-Routenplanung erlaubst." } } } },
    "Subscriptions automatically renew unless canceled at least 24 hours before the current period ends. Payment is charged to your Apple Account at confirmation. You can manage or cancel in App Store subscription settings." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Abos verlängern sich automatisch, sofern du nicht mindestens 24 Stunden vor Ablauf kündigst. Die Zahlung wird bei Bestätigung deinem Apple-Account belastet. Verwalte oder kündige dein Abo in den App-Store-Einstellungen." } } } },
    "Your local Trail Profile needs a fresh start" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Dein lokales Wanderprofil muss neu angelegt werden" } } } },
    "You can close this screen without sending a request. Saved routes remain available." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Du kannst diesen Bildschirm schließen, ohne eine Anfrage zu senden. Gespeicherte Routen bleiben verfügbar." } } } },
    "You planned a verified route first. Explore Wanderful Premium only if it feels useful now." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Du hast zuerst eine echte Route geplant. Entdecke Wanderful Premium nur, wenn es dir jetzt wirklich hilft." } } } },
    "Your route remains available whether or not you subscribe. Choose a plan only if Wanderful Premium is right for you." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Deine Route bleibt verfügbar, egal ob du abonnierst. Wähle ein Abo nur, wenn Wanderful Premium zu dir passt." } } } },
    "Attributed research passage, not a verified statement about this route." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Zitierter Rechercheauszug, keine bestätigte Aussage über diese Route." } } } },
    "Check local rules & trail conditions" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Lokale Regeln und Wegbedingungen prüfen" } } } },
    "Confirm water availability & your supply" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wasserverfügbarkeit und Vorrat prüfen" } } } },
    "DAY " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "TAG " } } } },
    "Elevation profile" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Höhenprofil" } } } },
    "Google Search suggestions" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Google-Suchvorschläge" } } } },
    "Intent QA" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Absichtsprüfung" } } } },
    "Later" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Später" } } } },
    "Manage what you share and find help with your next route." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Verwalte, was du teilst, und finde Hilfe für deine nächste Route." } } } },
    "Mapped as " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Kartiert als " } } } },
    "No location track is saved or sent. Check weather, local rules and trail conditions before starting." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Es wird kein Standortverlauf gespeichert oder gesendet. Prüfe vor dem Start Wetter, lokale Regeln und Wegbedingungen." } } } },
    "Not on this route: " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Nicht auf dieser Route: " } } } },
    "Offline evidence check" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Offline-Nachweisprüfung" } } } },
    "Opening local setup…" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Lokale Einrichtung wird geöffnet …" } } } },
    "Or enter a specific starting area" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Oder gib einen genauen Startbereich ein" } } } },
    "PREVIEW" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "VORSCHAU" } } } },
    "Photo linked to " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Foto verknüpft mit " } } } },
    "Physical effort estimate: " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Geschätzte körperliche Anstrengung: " } } } },
    "Preferences remain requests until route evidence verifies them. They never guarantee scenery, access, conditions, difficulty, or safety." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Vorlieben bleiben Wünsche, bis Wegdaten sie belegen. Sie garantieren niemals Aussicht, Zugang, Bedingungen, Schwierigkeit oder Sicherheit." } } } },
    "Research before route selection — includes alternatives and unconfirmed context. Only the stops listed above belong to this route. Source statements may be outdated; they do not verify route conditions." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Recherche vor der Routenauswahl – mit Alternativen und unbestätigtem Kontext. Nur die oben aufgeführten Stopps gehören zu dieser Route. Quellen können veraltet sein und bestätigen keine Wegbedingungen." } } } },
    "Retry Cleanup" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bereinigung erneut versuchen" } } } },
    "Retry cleanup" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bereinigung erneut versuchen" } } } },
    "Retrying cleanup" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bereinigung wird wiederholt" } } } },
    "Route copilot" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Routenbegleitung" } } } },
    "Share your route & expected return" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Teile deine Route und geplante Rückkehr" } } } },
    "Source statement; current route conditions are not confirmed." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Quellenaussage; aktuelle Wegbedingungen sind nicht bestätigt." } } } },
    "Specific town, valley or trailhead" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Genauer Ort, Tal oder Wanderparkplatz" } } } },
    "The Apple basemap needs connectivity. Previously viewed areas may disappear without a network connection. Saving this route does not download a map." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Die Apple-Basiskarte benötigt eine Verbindung. Bereits angesehene Bereiche können ohne Netz verschwinden. Das Speichern dieser Route lädt keine Karte herunter." } } } },
    "The suggested kit covers hiking. Add your own activity-specific equipment below; this is not a complete kit for " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Die vorgeschlagene Ausrüstung ist für Wandern gedacht. Ergänze unten eigenes, aktivitätsspezifisches Material; dies ist keine vollständige Ausrüstung für " } } } },
    "These are defaults, not rules. A route request you make now always wins." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Das sind Vorgaben, keine Regeln. Deine aktuelle Routenanfrage hat immer Vorrang." } } } },
    "What you’ll see along the way" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Das siehst du unterwegs" } } } },
    "While guidance is active" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Während die Routenführung läuft" } } } },
    "YOUR TRAIL PROFILE" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "DEIN WANDERPROFIL" } } } },
    "Applies: " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Gilt: " } } } },
    "CURRENT ROUTE" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "AKTUELLE ROUTE" } } } },
    "Choose only what feels useful. “I don’t know yet” stays unknown." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wähle nur, was dir hilfreich erscheint. „Weiß ich noch nicht“ bleibt offen." } } } },
    "End Route Guidance" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Routenführung beenden" } } } },
    "Entrance is " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Eingang ist " } } } },
    "MUST-HAVE" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "MUSS DABEI SEIN" } } } },
    "Onboarding progress" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Einrichtungsfortschritt" } } } },
    "Options for " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Optionen für " } } } },
    "Published: " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Veröffentlicht: " } } } },
    "Rebalancing your route…" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Deine Route wird angepasst …" } } } },
    "Recenter map on your position" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Karte auf deinen Standort zentrieren" } } } },
    "Removes this route from Saved. The current guidance session keeps its route until you end it." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Entfernt diese Route aus Gespeichert. Die laufende Routenführung behält ihre Route, bis du sie beendest." } } } },
    "Route Guidance map" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Karte der Routenführung" } } } },
    "Route comparison: " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Routenvergleich: " } } } },
    "Save the mapped route and available instructions. Reopen it from Saved after closing the app; start guidance again manually." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Speichere die kartierte Route und verfügbare Hinweise. Öffne sie nach dem Schließen der App unter Gespeichert und starte die Führung bei Bedarf erneut." } } } },
    "Source snapshot: " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Quellenstand: " } } } },
    "Start Route Guidance" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Routenführung starten" } } } },
    "Start guidance while the app is open. Location updates continue during screen lock and app changes. Pause or End stops location use. Force-quitting the app or restarting your iPhone ends the session." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Starte die Führung bei geöffneter App. Standortupdates laufen bei gesperrtem Bildschirm und App-Wechsel weiter. Pausieren oder Beenden stoppt die Standortnutzung. Das Beenden der App oder ein iPhone-Neustart beendet die Sitzung." } } } },
    "Start here with a precise reading. Active guidance continues during app changes and screen lock." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Starte hier mit einem genauen Standort. Die aktive Führung läuft bei App-Wechsel und gesperrtem Bildschirm weiter." } } } },
    "This removes the local profile and its resumable draft from this iPhone. Remote sync is not active in V1. Your saved routes are not affected." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Das entfernt das lokale Profil und den fortsetzbaren Entwurf von diesem iPhone. In Version 1 ist keine Fernsynchronisierung aktiv. Deine gespeicherten Routen bleiben erhalten." } } } },
    "This route has multiple days. Choose an overnight style if you plan to stay out." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Diese Route dauert mehrere Tage. Wähle eine Übernachtungsart, wenn du unterwegs bleiben möchtest." } } } },
    "WHAT’S NEXT" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "WAS ALS NÄCHSTES KOMMT" } } } },
    "Wanderful Premium" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wanderful Premium" } } } },
    "Wanderful found one distinct loop for this start and distance. A nearby trailhead or different distance may yield alternatives." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wanderful hat für diesen Start und diese Strecke eine eigenständige Rundtour gefunden. Ein nahegelegener Wanderparkplatz oder eine andere Strecke kann weitere Optionen ergeben." } } } },
    "Wanderful will only add this answer to the missing part of your request." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wanderful ergänzt diese Antwort nur bei dem fehlenden Teil deiner Anfrage." } } } },
    "Wanderful. A focused planner for routed outdoor options." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wanderful. Ein klarer Planer für echte Outdoor-Routen." } } } },
    "Where would you like to go?" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wohin möchtest du gehen?" } } } },
    "Wanderful today" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wanderful heute" } } } },
    "Your Trail Profile will stay available, but every planning preference will return to “Not set yet.”" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Dein Wanderprofil bleibt erhalten, aber alle Planungsvorlieben werden auf „Noch nicht festgelegt“ zurückgesetzt." } } } },
    "Your next route request always wins. Wanderful uses these defaults only when your request leaves a gap." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Deine nächste Routenanfrage hat immer Vorrang. Wanderful nutzt diese Vorgaben nur, wenn deine Anfrage etwas offenlässt." } } } },
    "per " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "pro " } } } },
    "Built around “" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Geplant rund um „" } } } },
    "Checked: " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Geprüft: " } } } },
    "Edit " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bearbeiten " } } } },
    "Restore " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wiederherstellen " } } } },
    "Subscribe for " : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Abonnieren für " } } } },
    "Where should" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wohin geht" } } } },
    "Applies: %@ – %@" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Gültig: %@ – %@" } } } },
    "Built around “%@”" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Geplant rund um „%@“" } } } },
    "Checked: %@" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Geprüft: %@" } } } },
    "Mapped as %@" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Kartiert als %@" } } } },
    "Published: %@" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Veröffentlicht: %@" } } } },
    "Restore %@" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@ wiederherstellen" } } } },
    "Subscribe for %@ per %@" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Für %@ pro %@ abonnieren" } } } },
    "%@ of %@ packed" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@ von %@ gepackt" } } } },
    "Account sign-in is not available in this build." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Die Kontoanmeldung ist in dieser App-Version nicht verfügbar." } } } },
    "Deletes Wanderful server account data and signs you out. Saved routes and packing lists on this iPhone stay here unless you delete them separately." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Löscht deine Wanderful-Kontodaten auf dem Server und meldet dich ab. Gespeicherte Routen und Packlisten auf diesem iPhone bleiben erhalten, bis du sie separat löschst." } } } },
    "No weather, water, access, campsite or safety claim is generated. Departure date and personal needs are not shared." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Es werden keine Zusagen zu Wetter, Wasser, Zugang, Campingplatz oder Sicherheit erzeugt. Startdatum und persönliche Bedürfnisse werden nicht geteilt." } } } },
    "Photos are Wikimedia Commons images linked from each stop’s Wikidata record. Availability varies by place." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Fotos stammen aus Wikimedia Commons und sind mit dem Wikidata-Eintrag jedes Stopps verknüpft. Die Verfügbarkeit ist je nach Ort unterschiedlich." } } } },
    "Saved routes and packing lists remain on this iPhone." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Gespeicherte Routen und Packlisten bleiben auf diesem iPhone." } } } },
    "Getting suggestions…" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Vorschläge werden erstellt …" } } } },
    "Suggest extras with AI" : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Zusätzliche Ausrüstung per KI vorschlagen" } } } },
    "Review the optional additions before packing." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Prüfe die optionalen Ergänzungen, bevor du packst." } } } },
    "AI suggestions are unavailable. Your packing list is unchanged." : { "localizations" : { "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "KI-Vorschläge sind nicht verfügbar. Deine Packliste bleibt unverändert." } } } },
    "Die App auf Deutsch nutzen" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Use the app in German" } } }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
